      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Tetrahedral Dy4 cluster 1 is an SMM with weak intramolecular antiferromagnetic coupling (Jex = -0.30 cm-1). χMT at 300 K is 54.54 cm3 K mol-1 (expected 56.68 for four DyIII), remaining roughly constant to 70 K then falling to 12.26 cm3 K mol-1 at 1.8 K. Magnetization does not saturate at 7 T below 8 K. Frequency-dependent ac susceptibility below 15 K gives Ueff = 23.42 K and τ0 = 8.2×10-8 s. Micro-SQUID loops show temperature-dependent hysteresis with Hc = 0.6 T at 0.04 K and a QTM-related step near 0.5 T.",
